{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"In contrast, during turning freeze, there was an increase in PMC-STN alpha coherence (p = 0.048) and a decrease in M1-STN alpha coherence (p = 0.043) during the TurnStart phase (Fig. 3B).\",\n    \"B Freezing of Turning: A delayed and exaggerated increase in PMC-STN alpha coherence and concurrent decoupling of M1-STN alpha coherence was observed during the TurnStart phase.\",\n    \"Increased PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase (but not during the TurnStart phase) relative to walking predicted shorter freezing episodes (β = 0.205, p = 0.006).\",\n    \"Our analysis revealed that the decreases in the PMC alpha power (β = 0.154, p = 0.035) (Fig. 4A) and increases in PMC-STN alpha coherence (β = 0.205, p = 0.006) (Fig. 4B) during the TurnPre phase, but not the TurnStart phase, significantly predicted the freezing duration within the trial.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Increased PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase (but not during the TurnStart phase) relative to walking predicted shorter freezing episodes (β = 0.205, p = 0.006).\",\n    \"Percentage Change (%) = (Value_Walk − Value_TurnPre or TurnStart) / Value_Walk × 100\",\n    \"A linear mixed-effects model was employed to assess whether phase-specific changes in alpha power (M1, PMC) and alpha coherence (M1-STN, PMC-STN) predicted the duration of freezing.\",\n    \"We observed an increase in PMC-STN alpha coherence during TurnPre in normal turning, suggesting the role of PMC-STN connectivity in the initiation of the turning task. The increased coherence between the PMC and STN may reflect a compensatory mechanism to maintain motor control in the face of disrupted cortical signals; however, this abnormal coupling could also contribute to the rigidity and motor impairments characteristic of FOG31,32.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法属于部分支持。其记录的TurnStart阶段PMC-STN alpha coherence增加确实有明确原文依据，但这与TurnPre阶段coherence变化预测冻结持续时间是两个不同的结果，不能混为一谈。关于关联方向，Figure 4图注明确指出TurnPre阶段PMC-STN alpha coherence增加预测较短的冻结持续时间。方法部分的计算公式为(Walk−Turn)/Walk，意味着Turn阶段coherence增加对应负向的变化值；结合β=0.205的正回归系数，恰好与Figure 4图注所述的负向关联一致。Results正文虽然使用了“increases ... predicted the freezing duration”这种没有明确说明方向的表述，但没有报告相反方向，因此属于方向描述不够具体，而不是内部矛盾。指控者关于原文关联方向明确、报告将其判定为不明确属于误读的判断有充分依据。关于H4，原文没有直接使用H4这一编号，但Discussion明确提出coherence增加“may reflect a compensatory mechanism”，因此代偿性解释作为一种可能性有原文支持。同时，原文还提出异常耦合也可能参与FOG相关运动障碍，说明代偿解释并非唯一解释。研究采用线性混合效应模型分析预测关系，并未建立因果关系，因此不能将该关联解释为已经证实的因果机制。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f51f965b-1100-4a50-91ff-8bc82c8d3b70", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T125328448196Z", "elapsed_seconds": 139.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:55:48.401697+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7b763a5d32a45529a5b25e8b878c3a6ce054353e3da64b9420a82da0fbed84f7", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T125328448196Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9438a44ecc0814a4651c0d5d845ec3c28f914de34be7ee437c92c15843702371"}}}
